      "id": "4B5DC75B96526111",
      "title": "Continue from WSV workshop",
      "subtitle": "WSV → CIV",
      "description": [
        "\"The front-stage chassis is ready. This chapter continues to connect the main materials, electronics and facilities to create the first batch of CIV mechanical cubes.\"",
        "\"First connect the main material production line, and then arrange the merging process after recycling and boosting. Please check JEI for materials, power and working conditions.\""
