      "subtitle": "Reserve independent ports for four systems",
      "description": [
        "\"Integrate the front-end interface and the Civilization IV system into an interconnected backplane. The four systems are connected through their respective ports, and the subsequent circuits and execution components are put into the entire backplane.\""
